<title>HONG KONG: Asian Banking in $60 mln FRCD - bankers.</title>
<headline>Asian Banking in $60 mln FRCD - bankers.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian Banking Corp has verbally mandated six banks to arrange a US$60 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the issue is likely to have a final maturity of five years with a put and a call option in year three.</p>
<p>The facility will be priced at par to float at 55 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Fees are not available yet.</p>
<p>The six arrangers are KEB International London, Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commercial Bank of Korea, Industrial Bank of Korea, LTCB Asia and WestLB Asia Pacific.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
